          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, column III",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">two acquaintances of Azhar 16 b. Ya\u1e25y\u0101 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the acquaintance of the man from Damietta 6&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the daughter of al-Thulayth 2 the daughter of al-Jady 2&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the sister of ls\u1e25aq 2 b. Sa\u02bf\u0101da&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the son of the writer/singer of liturgical poetry 6 Sa\u02bf\u0101da 4&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm Miryam 2 Ab\u016b Shaykha 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Barak\u0101t the fortune teller? (al-mun\u0101dal\u012b) 4&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sal\u0101ma 4 the man from Qalah\u0101 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm \u1e92ar\u012bfa 4 the wife of \u02bfAw\u0101\u1e0d 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm Hil\u0101la 2 the man with tremors 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the worker and/or dealer in lead 5 the wife of the furrier 5</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">b. D\u0101n\u012bl a newcomer 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the Rayyis b. Joseph (may his) m(emory be) b(lessed) [...] the glassmaker 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">// the son // of the mother-in-law of al-Mu\u1e6dalib\u012b 2 (a mim above the line = fa-sallam, received)</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a newcomer elder of Baghdad 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the cantor b. al-Qu\u1e0d\u0101\u02bf\u012b (son of the healer of stomach ailments) 6 the mother-in-law of b. Al[-...]. 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the acquaintance of Abu\u02bel-Mun\u0101 8</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the daughter of \u1e24ash\u012bka 5 Ab\u016b Mukht\u0101r 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">his sister 3 the wife of the tanner 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ya\u02bfq\u016bb the blind man 3 Makhl\u016bf the [b]lind man 2</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
